  "method": "Read-only audit of all 120 current fields. Independent grid-cell walking, initial blocking rays and longest dependency chain; not measured player difficulty. Nine actual production-rendered fields inspected using explicit synthetic QA saves. Those fixtures/screenshots are not earned playthrough or delivery-GIF evidence.",
