  "findings": [
    "Silhouette variety and longer bent paths exist; larger fields require more visual search.",
    "Density is inconsistent: some filled silhouettes contain large accidental internal holes. Hard/Nightmare labels are not justified by arrow counts alone.",
    "Average initial free-arrow share is about 65% for c21-c120 and 60% for Nightmare. Longer blocking chains exist, but many arrows initially leave without another removal.",
    "Content quality needs a versioned authoring/selection pass and real-player validation before calling the full bank tight and challenging."
